            "value" : "Sources: Kraken, Coinbase, Binance (crypto, without a key), Alpaca (US stocks, key in Settings under “Prices”). The broker’s CFDs and currencies have no free price; mapping to the underlying counts as an approximation. German prices are not connected yet."
